---
export const prerender = true;
import { readFile } from "node:fs/promises";
import path from "node:path";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const contentHtml = await readFile(
  path.join(
    process.cwd(),
    "src/content/main/complemento-di-sviluppo-rurale-per-il-veneto-2023-2027-srd02.html",
  ),
  "utf8",
);
---

<!--
  Second EU/Veneto rural-development funding-disclosure page (Misura SRD02/B),
  following the exact pattern already established for Task 64's SRD01 page —
  see that page's own index.astro comment for the full reasoning (internal
  copy instead of an external link, bodyClass convention, no EN/DE equivalent
  invented since the live site has none for this kind of page either).

  Deliberately kept as a fully separate page (not merged with the SRD01 page
  via tabs/sections) per explicit decision: each funded "operazione" under the
  CSR Veneto 2023-2027 has its own legally-tied disclosure requirements (own
  logos, own operation code, own text), confirmed against the official
  regional guidelines (Regione del Veneto, Allegato A al Decreto n. 22 del 22
  Febbraio 2024) — combining two different operations' disclosures risked
  exactly the kind of ambiguity those rules are meant to prevent.

  Content (banner images + every field below) copied verbatim from the
  beneficiary-supplied source document — not paraphrased, not corrected, not
  reconciled with SRD01's own wording even where the two differ (e.g. this
  page says "Programma di sviluppo rurale" / "Direzione AdG FEASR e Foreste"
  where SRD01 says "Complemento di sviluppo Rurale" / "...Bonifica e
  Irrigazione" — confirmed intentional, not an inconsistency to fix).

  Known judgment call, not given explicitly in the source material: the H1
  title text reuses SRD01's exact title ("Complemento di sviluppo Rurale per
  il Veneto 2023-2027", the overarching programme name) for visual/structural
  consistency between the two pages, since no distinct page title was
  supplied — flagged for the site owner to override if a different title is
  preferred.
-->
<BaseLayout
  title="Complemento di sviluppo Rurale per il Veneto 2023-2027 - Misura SRD02/B - Rigoni Vittorino"
  description="Intervento SRD02/B: informazioni sul finanziamento ricevuto da Rigoni Vittorino nell'ambito del Complemento di sviluppo Rurale per il Veneto 2023-2027."
  ogTitle="Complemento di sviluppo Rurale per il Veneto 2023-2027 - Misura SRD02/B"
  bodyClass="singular missing-post-thumbnail"
  lang="it"
>
  <Fragment set:html={contentHtml} />
</BaseLayout>
